on","ownerId":"k-40","title":"撕裂幕布","titleEn":"Ripped Curtain","rarity":"uncommon","description":["来自海盗洞穴，住在那里的电子玩偶非常喜欢这个玩意儿。","斧子命中逃生者时，该逃生者会受到出血与重伤状态影响，持续60秒。","出血状态会使治疗进度在中断治疗后回退，并使受伤逃生者留下的血迹增加。该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。","重伤状态会使治疗所需时间增加25%，该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_RippedCurtain.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Ripped_Curtain","pinyin":"siliemubu","initials":"slmb"},{"id":"addon:fazbear_s_fright:party_hat","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-40","title":"派对帽","titleEn":"Party Hat","rarity":"uncommon","description":["无论他们怎么哀求，派对都不会结束。","斧子嵌入环境时：","·其影响范围在3秒内逐渐增加至250%。","·影响范围持续时间缩短20%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_PartyHat.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Party_Hat","pinyin":"paiduimao","initials":"pdm"},{"id":"addon:fazbear_s_fright:help_wanted_ad","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-40","title":"招聘启事广告","titleEn":"Help Wanted Ad","rarity":"common","description":["谁都难免有需要帮手的时候...","斧子投掷蓄力时，可以预览初始抛物线。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_HelpWantedAd.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Help_Wanted_Ad","pinyin":"zhaopinqishiguanggao","initials":"zpqsgg"},{"id":"addon:fazbear_s_fright:greasy_paper_plate","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-40","title":"油腻纸盘","titleEn":"Greasy Paper Plate","rarity":"common","description":["它会粘在接触到的所有东西上。不管用多少肥皂都洗不掉。","逃生者移除斧子所需时间延长15%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_GreasyPaperPlate.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Greasy_Paper_Plate","pinyin":"younizhipan","initials":"ynzp"},{"id":"addon:fazbear_s_fright:rotten_pizza","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-40","title":"腐烂披萨","titleEn":"Rotten Pizza","rarity":"common","description":["食物中毒可不是好笑的事。","斧子有效范围内杀手本能持续时间增加100%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_RottenPizza.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Rotten_Pizza","pinyin":"fulanpisa","initials":"flps"},